{"reviewedAt":"2026-10-11T04:35:20.448196+00:00","sources":[{"id":"glottography-asher2007-v2","title":"Glottography · 2007世界语言图集使用区（v2.0）","url":"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.18613195","repository":"https://github.com/Glottography/asher2007world/tree/20102238acf12a2b82bd4d752356687ee2acfd6d","scientificDescriptor":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41597-025-05828-6","citation":"The Glottography Consortium (2026). Glottography dataset derived from Asher and Moseley 2007 \"Atlas of the World's Languages\" (v2.0). Zenodo. Asher, R. E. & Christopher J. Moseley (eds.) (2007). Atlas of the World's Languages. 2nd edn. Routledge.","version":"v2.0","commit":"20102238acf12a2b82bd4d752356687ee2acfd6d","period":"2007年图集的contemporary使用区；并非2026实时分布","license":"CC BY 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","inputPath":"data/raw/language-areas/languages.geojson","inputSha256":"889365bc8c8ede1e4c291e54c036090b995e50b8cacac1e64eea7c9f552896f0","inputs":[{"path":"data/raw/language-areas/languages.geojson","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Glottography/asher2007world/20102238acf12a2b82bd4d752356687ee2acfd6d/cldf/contemporary/languages.geojson","sha256":"889365bc8c8ede1e4c291e54c036090b995e50b8cacac1e64eea7c9f552896f0","size":92985498},{"path":"data/raw/language-areas/languages.csv","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Glottography/asher2007world/20102238acf12a2b82bd4d752356687ee2acfd6d/cldf/contemporary/languages.csv","sha256":"da3132a01453621576dc4c17e2f7345e71d9f363f0ac5ae4f56b52e8001893d8","size":879463},{"path":"data/raw/language-areas/contributions.csv","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Glottography/asher2007world/20102238acf12a2b82bd4d752356687ee2acfd6d/cldf/contemporary/contributions.csv","sha256":"4d8e1383115fc662bb576f163fff7f9033aed768fe5588c06096f969ff5b9a77","size":704973},{"path":"data/raw/language-areas/contemporary-metadata.json","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Glottography/asher2007world/20102238acf12a2b82bd4d752356687ee2acfd6d/cldf/contemporary/contemporary-metadata.json","sha256":"37e04289c030af9fabbb69eb2f71afa6d36ad57c5f60ff9d0b4369bfa0f53948","size":14513},{"path":"data/raw/language-areas/LICENSE","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Glottography/asher2007world/20102238acf12a2b82bd4d752356687ee2acfd6d/LICENSE","sha256":"945fbcb37deca05bccd7c3ca0e261679f1f5373515504fdbad68f6f3cf6f49b9","size":18652},{"path":"data/raw/language-areas/VALIDATION.md","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Glottography/asher2007world/20102238acf12a2b82bd4d752356687ee2acfd6d/VALIDATION.md","sha256":"6a86765961995d85e2b2b5dc32436165eaa2ec53df58c44ff2787f2adbbe0335","size":18977}],"processing":"只使用contemporary/languages.geojson已聚合的真实语言级面。按真实Glottocode连接本站Glottolog 5.3语言与语系名称；排除29条Bookkeeping记录。拓扑保留简化最大容差0.04°，小面积对象自适应减小容差；坐标舍入通过有效性及部件/洞数量检验后采用。各语言独立简化，不声称共边完全一致，不以点扩散、国家边界、人口或官方地位补面。","notes":["色面来自2007年《世界语言地图集》的使用区图，经Glottography数字化；不是2026年实时语言分布。","使用contemporary资料集，未混入欧洲殖民接触时的traditional范围；原图资料年份并不统一，未注明的图按出版年2007登记。","范围为地图集概括的语言使用区，不能据此判断人口、使用者比例或官方地位，也不表示区域内人人只使用这一种语言。","多语言交错与重叠在原图中表示不充分；无法精确分配给某一语言的语组区域未作为单一语言面展示。空白不表示没有语言使用者。","语言与方言的划分沿用源数据在Glottolog语言层级的聚合；名称与语系按本站Glottolog 5.3的真实Glottocode连接，排除bookkeeping条目。","边界为便于全球探索而简化的参考范围；不同语言可重叠，不能作为人口普查边界或精确行政界线。"]}],"artifacts":[{"path":"/data/language-areas.geojson","sha256":"45a17e32b60a7d30504e040d4591f27b975e87e10b7cba68d02b384d57a6ef61","size":5028594},{"path":"/data/language-areas-meta.json","sha256":"a9728897f2da926dfa24bba8d482cab64afa1471e42e5dd0b286d6a8e4a0cdbb","size":943885}],"coverage":{"languages":4033,"families":180,"referencePointsWithoutArea":4037}}
